When editing `apps/mobile/**`:

- Follow `AGENTS.md` dependency and provider rules.
- Prefer existing bootstrap, providers, navigation, and feature layout.
- Do not import `@sujeetd7/ai-engineering-*` into mobile runtime.
- Use `@nexus/shared-ui` public API for UI.
